  "name": "leptos-use",
  "description": "leptos-use is an extensive suite of reactive composables for the Leptos framework, designed to facilitate type-safe interactions between Rust-based WebAssembly applications and standard browser APIs. It provides ergonomic abstractions for complex tasks such as state persistence, sensory input processing, and asynchronous coordination, drawing heavily from functional reactive programming paradigms. By supporting isomorphic execution, the library ensures that utilities behave predictably across client-side hydration and server-side rendering contexts.",
